  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A line in the&nbsp;<em>xy</em>-plane has a slope of <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> and passes through the point&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 5 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. The equation <math alttext=\"y equals p x plus r\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> defines the line, where <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math> are constants. What is the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
